            "review_text": "Annie\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nAdorable restaurant in Hanoi\nNov 2016 • Friends\nFresh n Clean <3 I was impressed by their green style and delicious Vietnames food. An amazing restaurant in Hanoi!!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 19, 2017\nCuonnroll_Restaurant\nDear Annie,\nThank you for giving us a perfect rating on TripAdvisor. It is an absolute delight for us know that you have fully enjoyed your time at Cuon N Roll Restaurant, especially our food and interior design.\nWe look forward to welcoming you again in your next trip at Hanoi. \nYours sincerely,\nThe restaurant management.\nRead more\nWritten April 21, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
